flowchart TD
    REQ[User opens a lead] --> A{Admin, Manager,<br/>Ops Manager, Accounts?}
    A -->|Yes| OK([Access granted])
    A -->|No| B{Did they create<br/>this lead?}
    B -->|Yes| OK
    B -->|No| C{Role?}
    C -->|Sales Rep| D{assigned_rep_id<br/>= them?}
    C -->|Tele Caller| E{creator or<br/>tele_caller_id?}
    C -->|Documentation Head| F{Site visit complete<br/>and not Lost?}
    C -->|Documentation user| G{Assigned to them<br/>or holds doc task?}
    C -->|Installer| H{Lead is Won?}
    C -->|Partner| I{partner_id<br/>= them?}
    D -->|Yes| OK
    E -->|Yes| OK
    F -->|Yes| OK
    G -->|Yes| OK
    H -->|Yes| OK
    I -->|Yes| OK
    D & E & F & G & H & I -->|No| DENY([403 Access denied])

    classDef ok fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#0f172a
    classDef no fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#dc2626,color:#0f172a
    class OK ok
    class DENY no
